OL,3,GNEWSABrothers jailed for Christmas Day
OL,4,Akilling
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo brothers have been jailed for
OL,7,Fattacking a man outside a nightclub on
OL,8,FChristmas Day before fatally stabbing
OL,9,Fhim.
OL,11,FRichard and Trey Beckles carried out a
OL,12,F"brutal and sustained" attack on Trey
OL,13,FJohnson by De Fusion in Wolverhampton
OL,14,Fbefore later stabbing him outside a
OL,15,Fhouse in the city.
OL,17,FThe 30-year-old died in the early hours
OL,18,Fof 25 December last year from a single
OL,19,Fstab wound to his chest. The brothers
OL,20,Ffled after the killing before turning
OL,21,Fthemselves in days later, West Midlands
OL,22,FPolice said.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
